OL,3,GNEWSAMissing cat reunited with family
OL,4,Aafter 500 days
OL,5,
OL,6,FA cat that went missing for over 18
OL,7,Fmonths has been reunited with his
OL,8,Ffamily in Guernsey.
OL,10,FSalem escaped while his owners Krissi
OL,11,FCarre and her Daughter Ionie moved
OL,12,Fhouse in June of last year.
OL,14,FHe was identified through a Facebook
OL,15,Finitiative, and once captured was
OL,16,Ftreated at the GSPCA for ticks and an
OL,17,Fulcer found on his eye.
OL,19,FIonie said Salem's return was "one of
OL,20,Fthe happiest moments of my life."
